ork, but state never updated despite real dispatched events with substantial deltas in both axes.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On 苏绣 detail page gallery, clicking thumbnail 3 updated main image to \\\"苏绣 - 3\\\" and marked thumbnail 3 active; clicking thumbnail 2 (a broken image) updated the main area to show explicit failure text \\\"图片加载失败\\\" (image failed to load).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"With sort set to \\\"按年份\\\" (list reordered to 昆曲, 苏绣, 宜兴紫砂, 春节...), navigated into 昆曲 detail page and back (browser back). The homepage still showed sort combobox = \\\"按年份\\\" and the same reordered list, confirming sort selection persisted across detail-page navigation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each of the 8 heritage cards uses a distinct image (8 unique src URLs, no duplicates/generic placeholder reuse) and each img's alt attribute exactly matches its heritage item's Chinese name (e.g. alt=\\\"京剧\\\" for the Peking Opera card, alt=\\\"苏绣\\\" for Suzhou Embroidery), indicating images are individually assigned per item rather than a shared/mismatched default.\"}]}"
